{"title":"Indexing & Scopus: IAFOR Journal of Education","link":"https://iafor.org/indexing-scopus-iafor-journal-of-education/","date":1649656848000,"content":"<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/JoE-Indexing-banner-Scopus-150x150.jpg\" srcset=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/JoE-Indexing-banner-Scopus-150x150.jpg 150w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/JoE-Indexing-banner-Scopus-600x600.jpg 600w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/JoE-Indexing-banner-Scopus-100x100.jpg 100w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/JoE-Indexing-banner-Scopus-50x50.jpg 50w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/JoE-Indexing-banner-Scopus-300x300.jpg 300w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/JoE-Indexing-banner-Scopus-32x32.jpg 32w\" />One of the most frequent questions that we are asked about the IAFOR Journal of Education is whether it is indexed with Scopus. It is: we were granted Scopus indexing mid-2019. But what does this mean? Why should journals want to be indexed? And why Scopus? The IAFOR Journal of Education is currently indexed in <a href=\"https://iafor.org/indexing-scopus-iafor-journal-of-education/\">...</a>\n<p><a href=\"https://iafor.org/indexing-scopus-iafor-journal-of-education/\">Source</a></p>","author":"Publications","siteTitle":"The International Academic Forum (IAFOR)","siteHash":"db6175d8277e1d8dd86d5cc607b1dd9335cce255aa7e00b46d0931f23a0d47f6","entryHash":"7cfec8832a5d6a7b499d7985c3b8de399e161ed73c10b489eb7b190e2835b29f","category":"Interdisciplinary"}